        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 7615, Castletown Dummy Entry Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Weslock Castletown Dummy Entry Handleset has an old world feel. The handleset's beveled edges and slightly curved handle grant it a simple grace that is an easy way to enhance the look of any door. Made of solid bronze, it is available in oil rubbed bronze or matte black finishes. A dummy handleset, it is just for looks; it neither latches nor locks. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull or on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function--neither locking nor latching. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/castletown-single-cylinder-entry-handleset-weslock-7625-7400\"><b>Castletown Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/castletown-double-cylinder-entry-handleset-weslock-7625-7402\"><b>Castletown Double Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditionally styled handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-molten-bronze-collection\"><b>Weslock Molten Bronze Collection</b></a> which features easy installation as well as lifetime mechanical and finish warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Castletown Dummy Entry Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid molten bronze.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Molten Bronze Castletown Dummy Entry Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Exterior Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Blank Deadbolt Plate Length (exterior and interior): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Blank Deadbolt Plate Width (exterior and interior): 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Blank Deadbolt Plate Projection (exterior and interior): 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Length: 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Handle Plate Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Handle Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Handle Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 5\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
